 	$A^x=\{A^x_a\}_a$ and $B^x=\{B^x_a\}_a$ be measurement families with a
 	common outcome set, and suppose that $D_\psi(A,B)\leq\delta$. If the
 	multipliers $S_z^x$ satisfy
